    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53704" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβλώσκω</span></b> , poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέρχομαι</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go
